# Generated bundles do NOT live in git — see README.md "Bundle deliverables".
# This .gitignore is a local belt-and-braces alongside any repo-wide rules.

# PPTX/DOCX outputs
*.pptx
*.docx

# HTML players (typically large; lives in Drive)
*_player.html
player.html

# PDFs (alternate output)
*.pdf

# Audio
*.mp3
*.wav

# Concept imagery (DALL-E outputs) — checked-in are only the *prompts*,
# not the images themselves.
concept_images/
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
# But preserve diagram renders if we ever check them in (we currently don't)
!diagrams/*.png
!diagrams/*.svg

# Stage-output scratch
build/
out/
stage*/
